{"id":"brief","name":"Brief","tagline":"Browse command-line cheatsheets","blurb":"Brief is an app for browsing command-line cheatsheets.","description":"Brief is an app for browsing command-line cheatsheets. It lets you search through thousands\nof command-line tools across multiple platforms and languages, providing simplified help\npages.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Works completely offline.\n\n• Fuzzy search through the available commands.\n\n• Filter platform specific commands (Linux, Windows, Android, etc.).\n\n• View command help pages in multiple available languages.\n\n• Change the command argument format between long (`ls --all`) or short (`ls -a`).\n\n• Lets you update the cache within the app to download the latest data.","developer":"Shone Binu","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/icons/128x128/io.github.shonebinu.Brief.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-1_752x526@1.png","w":1000,"h":700},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-2_752x526@1.png","w":1000,"h":700},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-3_752x526@1.png","w":1000,"h":700},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/shonebinu.Brief/dc388cfa123fbfbb1124bb56473e4071/screenshots/image-4_224x351@1.p